{"text": "IN THE CIRCUIT COURT OF THE STATE OF OREGON FOR THE COUNTY OF LANE\n\nIn the Matter of the Change of Name and Sex Designation of DANIEL JOSEPH PRZYBYLSKI, Petitioner\n\nCase No. 25PB04418 · PETITION (ORS 33.410, ORS 33.460) · DRAFT 11/10/2025 — not filed\n\nPetitioner states:\n\n- 1. My current legal name is Daniel Joseph Przybylski. I ask the court to change my name to Dana Josephine Przybylski.\n\n- 2. I was born on September 26, 1997 in Toledo, Ohio. My Ohio birth certificate is file number 1997-134418.\n\n- 3. I live at 2255 Kincaid Street, Apt. 9, Eugene, OR 97405, and have lived in Lane County for more than six years.\n\n- 4. I ask the court to change my legal sex designation from male to female. I have undergone treatment appropriate for me for the purpose of affirming my gender identity.\n\n- 5. I am not asking for this change to avoid debts or for any fraudulent purpose. I am not required to register as a sex offender. I have no criminal convictions.\n\n- 6. I ask that the record of this case be sealed and that no public notice be posted, because I was assaulted in 2023 after a co-worker shared my former name online.\n\nInformation for the court (confidential information form, UTCR 2.130)\n\nItem\tDetail\n\nOregon driver license\t4418720\n\nSocial Security number (last four)\t1229\n\nPhone\t541-555-0133\n\nEmail\tdana.j.prz@emeraldmail.example\n\nFee waiver\tRequested. Receives SNAP and is on the Oregon Health Plan; monthly income $1,480. Filing fee $124.\n\nClinic notes (not part of the petition)\n\n- Client goes by Dana; do not use the former first name when calling. Voicemail is fine on the number above.\n\n- Supporting letter requested from Dr. Ifeoma Chukwudi at McKenzie River Gender Health confirming hormone therapy since 2022. Not required by the statute; the client wants it for the passport application later.\n\n- After the judgment: Social Security first, then DMV, then Ohio vital statistics for the birth certificate. Ohio will want a certified copy and $40.\n\n- Student loan servicer and the credit union still have \"Danny Przybylski\". Employer payroll already uses Dana.\n\n- Prepared by Noelani Kapaona, law student, under supervision, Emerald Valley Legal Aid Clinic. Intake no. LAC-25-1187. Hearing, if the judge wants one, is likely the week of December 8.", "kind": "Web page", "detail": "384 words", "notes": [], "names": {"people": ["Daniel Joseph Przybylski", "Dana Josephine Przybylski", "Ifeoma Chukwudi", "Danny Przybylski", "Dana"], "companies": ["Oregon", "McKenzie River Gender Health", "emeraldmail", "Emerald Valley Legal Aid Clinic"]}, "topics": {"places": ["Oregon", "Lane County", "Eugene", "Emerald Valley Legal Aid Clinic"], "health": ["gender identity", "hormone therapy", "assault", "criminal convictions"], "sensitive": ["former first name", "social security number", "Oregon driver license"], "names": ["Daniel", "Joseph", "Dana", "Danny", "Noelani"]}, "chunks": 2, "chunkErrors": 0, "topicErrors": 0, "importMs": 0.6999999955296516, "modelMs": 16912.70000000298, "topicMs": 23357.5, "detectors": ["email", "url", "ip", "iban", "card", "card_exp", "cvv", "ssn", "bn_ca", "sin_ca", "ein", "card_partial", "phone", "dob", "age90", "date", "passport_dl", "routing", "credential", "device", "vin", "record", "account", "money", "street", "zip", "postal_ca", "places", "names", "sensitive_topics"], "detections": [{"start": 37, "end": 43, "text": "OREGON", "kind": "company", "source": "short-form", "canonical": "Oregon"}, {"start": 108, "end": 123, "text": "Sex Designation", "kind": "person", "source": "short-form", "canonical": "Sex Designation"}, {"start": 127, "end": 151, "text": "DANIEL JOSEPH PRZYBYLSKI", "kind": "person", "source": "short-form", "canonical": "Daniel Joseph Przybylski"}, {"start": 174, "end": 183, "text": "25PB04418", "kind": "record", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "25PB04418"}, {"start": 228, "end": 238, "text": "11/10/2025", "kind": "date", "source": "pattern", "canonical": 